# S014514 candidate summary

The candidate adds the path-preserving Rust translation for
`include/linux/nfs_iostat.h`.

- Preserves `NFS_IOSTAT_VERS` as `"1.1"`.
- Preserves both C enum type namespaces as `i32` aliases and exposes all
  enumerator names with source-order values, including the two max sentinels.
- Contains only declarations; the upstream header has no executable behavior,
  allocation, synchronization, ownership transfer, or ABI-visible storage.
